phantasms.skill:
Before using a ULT, skill or normal attack, gains {{1–5}} random [Koi Blessing] effects below. 
There is a {{100%}} chance to gain {{1}} of them, a {{35%}} chance to gain {{2}}, a {{15%}} chance to gain {{3}}, a {{10%}} chance to gain {{4}}, and a {{1%}} chance to gain all {{5}}. Priority to Blessing you don't have.
When all five different Blessings are active together, immediately restore {{25%}} of Max HP and gain the [Nishiki]:

[Koi Blessing]: Lasts for {{1}} round and cannot be dispelled:

[Kuro]: Increases bearer's ATK by {{{0}}}

[Akane]: Increases bearer's CRIT by {{{0}}}

[Gunjo]: Increases bearer's DMG UP by {{{0}}}

[Sakura]: Increases bearer's DMG Reduction by {{{0}}}

[Koji]: Increases bearer's DEF by {{{0}}}

[Nishiki]: Immune to all control effects, lasts for {{2}} rounds, cannot be dispelled.
